# Voxaro AI Studio Environment Configuration

# Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 Client ID (From https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials)
# Paste your Client ID below to enable live Google One-Tap and popup sign-in
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Optional custom API base URL
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.voxaro.ai
